sources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 32, "prompt": "Jonathan believes that having family present in critical care units\nA will cause disharmony among healthcare professionals.\nB makes little difference to the treatment given to patients.\nC is potentially dangerous to both staff and patients.", "sourcePage": 168, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 171, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 33, "prompt": "Jonathan uses statistical information to show that after visiting hours were\nopened\nA clinicians experienced higher levels of fatigue.\nB the attitude of staff remained positive.\nC nurses felt more of a strain than other staff.", "sourcePage": 168, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 171, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 34, "prompt": "Jonathan says that the possibility of family burnout is an important issue\nbecause\nA it is an area that has yet to be sufficiently studied.\nB the amount of resources needed to overcome it is too great.\nC it should be considered alongside the change in visiting hours.", "sourcePage": 168, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 171, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 35, "prompt": "What does Jonathan say about full family presence during open visiting hours?\nA it provides the family a sense of fulfilment during stressful times\nB the benefits clearly outweigh any negative aspects\nC there are still times where it may be considered inappropriate", "sourcePage": 168, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 171, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 36, "prompt": "Jonathan closes by outlining the facts on open visiting hours in order to\nA rationalise any misconceptions listeners' may have.\nB illustrate that its opponents are mistaken in their views.\nC give advice to hospitals ready to implement the new policy.\n\nPart C.2", "sourcePage": 168, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 171, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 37, "prompt": "What issue does Susan state as being responsible for the change in obstetric\ncare?\nA recent studies by a number of hospitals\nB concerns over a newly introduced drug\nC the disturbing instances of maternal death", "sourcePage": 169, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 171, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 38, "prompt": "Susan believes that clamping of the umbilical cord\nA must be immediate within a matter of seconds.\nB should be delayed for longer than initially thought.\nC is effective in stopping blood entering the baby.", "sourcePage": 169, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 171, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 39, "prompt": "What issue does Susan identify as a concern?\nA people's involvement in changing the natural flow of blood\nB waiting too long before the baby breathes through its lungs\nC the need to keep the baby and the mother at an even level", "sourcePage": 169, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 171, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 40, "prompt": "What does Susan say about the current standards of clamping?\nA Trials have helped regulate waiting times.\nB Uncertainty has led to variations between times.\nC A universal waiting time is still a long way off.", "sourcePage": 169, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 171, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 41, "prompt": "Susan says the potential benefits of clamping\nA need to be made clearer to parents.\nB are in no way considered proof positive.\nC work on a number of different levels.", "sourcePage": 169, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 171, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 42, "prompt": "What does Susan think about possibly extending clamping times throughout\nall institutions?\nA its implementation is being prolonged unnecessarily\nB change needs to occur slowly to avoid potential problems\nC premature babies should be the initial focus of the scheme", "sourcePage": 169, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 171, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["6de02b94e3e418a2813f7e7085028ec39bace9a5d4427942650efc029f4956f5"], "answerSources": [], "matchEvidence": "Exact original recording SHA-256 in the verified Jahshan collection"}]}
